    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "9A4E4FC60C3129F7",
      "text": "Mit ihren Flügeln fängt sie den Wind, der durch\\nPaldea weht. So dreht sie sich gemächlich,\\r\\nund doch kraftvoll...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "9A4E4EC60C312844",
      "text": "Wenn ich meine Kämpfe mit einem Sprung\\nvon dort oben antrete, gewinnen sie an\\r\\nGewicht und Bedeutung![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "84589E7D23A65B06",
      "text": "Ganz meine Meinung!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "84589D7D23A65953",
      "text": "Öh, wenn Sie das sagen...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "9A4E4DC60C312691",
      "text": "Wusste ich doch, dass du meine Gedankengänge\\nverstehst! In puncto Kunst liegen wir eben auf\\r\\neiner Wellenlänge! Hahahaha![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "9A4E4CC60C3124DE",
      "text": "Ich denke, ich kann diesmal auf den Auftritt\\nverzichten und meine Sprunggelenke schonen.\\c\\nDieser Kampf verspricht auch so mein größtes\\nMeisterwerk zu werden![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "9A4E4BC60C31232B",
      "text": "Doch genug der Worte. Expressive Künstler wie\\nwir zwei müssen keine langen Reden schwingen.\\r\\nLassen wir Taten sprechen![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "9A4E4AC60C312178",
      "text": "Bühne frei für unser gemeinsames Kunstwerk!\\nBist du bereit?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "9A4E49C60C311FC5",
      "text": "In der Hitze des Gefechts gleichst du einer\\noriginellen Abstufung schillernder Farbtöne\\r\\nin konstanter Bewegung![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "9A4E48C60C311E12",
      "text": "Ungestüm und sanft zugleich – die Verkörperung\\neines nicht in Worte zu fassenden Kontrastes!\\r\\nIch ziehe den Hut vor dir![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "9A4ACBC60C2E13D4",
      "text": "Der Kampf gegen dich war herrlich erquickend.\\c\\nEr rief mir ins Gedächtnis zurück, wie ich mich\\neinst fühlte, als ich zum ersten Mal von der Muse\\r\\ngeküsst worden war...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "9A4ACCC60C2E1587",
      "text": "Oh, um ein Haar hätte ich vergessen, dass du ja\\nwegen der Inspektion hier bist, stimmt’s?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "9A4ACDC60C2E173A",
      "text": "Doch ach, das ist mir einerlei. Berichte dem\\nTop-Champ ruhig, was dir passend erscheint.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "9A4ACEC60C2E18ED",
      "text": "Für mich zählt einzig ein anderes Wort, das mit\\n„Insp“ beginnt, nämlich die Inspiration...\\c\\nUnd diese sprudelt gerade nur so aus mir heraus![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2020_kusa_020_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "9A4AC7C60C2E0D08",
      "text": "Die Gunst der Stunde will genutzt sein!\\c\\nEntschuldige, aber ich muss mich sogleich an\\nmein neues Werk setzen![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
